{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "7-12岁儿童能力判断与自卑形成机制", "content": "7到12岁期间，孩子会判断自己是否有能力；如果无法判断自己有能力，就会产生自卑。伙伴效应在这个阶段变得越来越重要，并成为孩子自尊最主要的来源。孩子需要通过在小伙伴中展现特定能力（如学习好、唱歌好、跑得快）来感到自豪、获得成就感，并通过这种自豪赢得大家的认可。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["7-12岁", "能力判断", "自卑", "伙伴效应", "自尊"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00001"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "在7-12岁阶段，鼓励或限制会影响孩子的能力判断和自卑感。", "reason": "a001说明孩子需要判断自己有能力，否则自卑；a002说明鼓励加强主动性，限制导致自卑，两者共同解释能力判断的形成机制。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "鼓励与限制对7-12岁儿童主动性的影响", "content": "在7到12岁阶段，如果鼓励孩子，会加强孩子的主动性，孩子会开始勤奋，并对实现目标的能力充满信心。如果不鼓励孩子的主动性，或者老师、父母给孩子很多限制，不让他去做，孩子就会开始感到自卑，怀疑自己的能力，觉得自己有的能力并不是好的，没有什么了不起的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["鼓励", "限制", "主动性", "勤奋", "自卑"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a002", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "鼓励或限制是影响能力判断和自卑形成的重要因素", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a003", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "当孩子的能力被否定时，会导致自卑。", "reason": "a003是a002中“限制导致自卑”的具体案例，织毛衣和溜溜球被否定导致孩子怀疑自己的能力。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a004", "kind": "causes", "condition": "当孩子因限制而怀疑自己时，潜力无法发挥。", "reason": "a002指出限制导致孩子怀疑自己的能力，a004指出自我怀疑导致无法发挥潜力，存在因果链。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0002"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "织毛衣和玩溜溜球被否定导致自卑的案例", "content": "案例：有孩子很会织毛衣，但老师觉得织毛衣没有用；有孩子很会玩溜溜球，在同学之间玩得很好，大家都觉得厉害，但老师父母觉得玩这个没有用，数学成绩考那么差。结果孩子开始感到自卑，怀疑自己的能力，觉得自己有的能力并不是好的，没有什么了不起的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["织毛衣", "溜溜球", "否定", "自卑", "案例"], "evidence": "hypothetical", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a003", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a002", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "该案例展示了不鼓励主动性导致自卑的机制", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0003"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "mechanism", "title": "自我怀疑对潜力发挥的影响", "content": "当孩子开始怀疑自己的时候，他就没有办法发挥自己的潜力。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["自我怀疑", "潜力"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a002", "kind": "causes", "condition": "不鼓励和限制导致自我怀疑，进而影响潜力发挥", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "通过失败培养谦卑与能力平衡", "content": "为了使孩子成长为一个谦卑的孩子，可能需要让孩子失败。必须在孩子获得能力和通过失败知道自己并不是全能的之间取得平衡。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["失败", "谦卑", "能力平衡"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a005", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a002", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "在培养孩子能力的同时，需要平衡失败以培养谦卑。", "reason": "a002强调鼓励和主动性，a005强调需要让孩子失败以培养谦卑，两者在方法上形成对比，但目标都是健康成长。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0005"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "7-12岁核心情感需求：支持和信任", "content": "7到12岁阶段孩子的核心情感需求是支持和信任。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["核心情感需求", "支持", "信任"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a006", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a007", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "满足支持和信任需求的第一步是提供积极情绪状态。", "reason": "a006指出核心情感需求是支持和信任，a007指出满足该需求首先要提供积极情绪状态，是具体步骤。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-13", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "共同适用：7-12岁核心情感需求。", "reason": "两者均认为7-12岁核心情感需求是支持和信任。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0006"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "提供积极情绪状态以满足情感需求", "content": "为了满足7-12岁孩子的支持和信任需求，首先要提供孩子积极的情绪状态。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["积极情绪", "情感需求"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a007", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-4060d6cddfd0", "blocks": ["b00004"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a006", "kind": "supports", "condition": "提供积极情绪状态是满足支持和信任需求的方法之一", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a008", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "提供积极情绪状态需要反思孩子和家庭的情绪状态。", "reason": "a007提出提供积极情绪状态，a008引导反思当前情绪状态，是实施步骤。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "积极情绪状态对认知发展有积极影响。", "reason": "a007强调提供积极情绪状态，a009指出情绪状态影响认知发展，说明积极情绪的重要性。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-4060d6cddfd0-c001:u0007"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
